1
00:00:13,390 --> 00:00:14,100
Okarin?

2
00:00:14,470 --> 00:00:15,140
How?

3
00:00:17,970 --> 00:00:18,890
How?

4
00:00:22,770 --> 00:00:25,190
I can touch her. She's really here.

5
00:00:28,690 --> 00:00:30,320
You're not a ghost?

6
00:00:30,320 --> 00:00:32,820
Do you want me to call the cops?

7
00:00:32,820 --> 00:00:34,620
I just want to know the truth!

8
00:00:34,620 --> 00:00:36,620
You were stabbed here...

9
00:00:38,700 --> 00:00:40,250
What do you mean by "truth"?

10
00:00:40,250 --> 00:00:42,040
Are you stupid? Do you want to die?

11
00:00:42,040 --> 00:00:43,920
That's Louise-chan's famous line!

12
00:00:43,920 --> 00:00:45,330
I saw it!

13
00:00:45,670 --> 00:00:47,380
You got stabbed!

14
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:49,710
Three hours ago,

15
00:00:49,710 --> 00:00:51,340
at Doctor Nakabachi's press conference, at the Radio Building!

16
00:00:51,340 --> 00:00:54,180
Okarin, try to control your delusions.

17
00:00:54,180 --> 00:00:56,930
Doctor Nakabachi's press conference was called off!

18
00:00:56,930 --> 00:00:57,970
But...

19
00:00:57,970 --> 00:01:00,890
Makise-san! It's almost time!

20
00:01:01,520 --> 00:01:02,440
All right!

21
00:01:02,440 --> 00:01:04,060
Wait! Are you running away?

22
00:01:06,150 --> 00:01:07,190
You're...

23
00:01:07,610 --> 00:01:08,900
I have a name.

24
00:01:09,570 --> 00:01:10,610
It's Hououin...

25
00:01:11,400 --> 00:01:12,490
Kyouma!

26
00:01:28,230 --> 00:01:28,430
